# --- Helm dependency build artefacts ---
# Chart.lock and the materialised sub-chart tarballs are produced by
# `helm dependency update` and are regenerated by CI before every
# deploy. They are not checked in (cf. the helmignore + the
# `helm dependency update` step in deploy:k8s).
infra/helm/*/Chart.lock
infra/helm/*/charts/*.tgz
